stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Active: Publish version
    Active --> Triggered: Consume versioned business event
    Triggered --> Deduplicate: Persist inbox and execution atomically
    Deduplicate --> Running: New event
    Deduplicate --> Completed: Duplicate event
    Running --> Evaluate: Load immutable workflow version/current policy
    Evaluate --> Action: Condition true
    Evaluate --> NextStep: Condition false
    Action --> Wait: Delay step
    Action --> NextStep: Immediate action succeeds
    Action --> Retry: Transient API/queue failure
    Action --> Failed: Permanent validation/policy failure
    Wait --> Due: Durable next_run_at reached
    Due --> Evaluate: Lease execution and continue
    Retry --> Running: Bounded retry succeeds
    Retry --> Failed: Retry budget exhausted
    NextStep --> Evaluate: More steps
    NextStep --> Completed: No more steps
    Active --> Paused: Operator pauses
    Paused --> Active: Operator resumes
    Running --> Cancelled: Suppression, deletion, or explicit exit policy
    Failed --> Running: Authorized manual retry
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Running
      Durable execution state and owner DB.
      Actions call owner APIs; no cross-service
      table reads or direct writes.
    end note

